\section{Known limitations}{

\itemize{
\item The bar group width (80\%), zero padding within a group, and tick-mark styling
(color/width/length) are fixed and not user-configurable; if you need different values, apply
\code{\link[=ro_gg_group_ticks]{ro_gg_group_ticks()}} and the geom parameters yourself instead of \code{ro_gg_plot()}.
\item Detecting whether a scale was already set by the user relies on \code{plot$scales$scales},
which is a bit buggy.
\item Facetted plots are not specifically handled; \code{\link[=ro_gg_y_title]{ro_gg_y_title()}} and \code{\link[=ro_gg_group_ticks]{ro_gg_group_ticks()}}
only look at the first panel.
}
